<title>THAILAND: Thai sugar vessel movements on June 18.</title>
<headline>Thai sugar vessel movements on June 18.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent surveyors detailed Thai sugar freight movement as follows (in tonne tel quels):</p>
<p>Vessel		  Position	  Quantity    Destination</p>
<p>Nan Ping Shan	 SLD June 09     14,000	Pakistan</p>
<p>Huang Hua	     SLD June 10     13,850	Japan</p>
<p>Long Chan Jiang     SLD June 12     13,500	China</p>
<p>Jilin		   SLD June 10	9,500	South Korea</p>
<p>Princess of Lorne   SLD June 15     13,200	Tanzania</p>
<p>Lucnum		  SLD June 13	9,500	Indonesia</p>
<p>Hua Tian		SLD June 12     14,000	South Korea</p>
<p>Sangthai Quartz     SLD June 13	  500	Singapore</p>
<p>Surin Navee	   SLD June 15	8,000	Japan</p>
<p>Sun Vazs		SLD June 13     13,300	South Korea</p>
<p>Solar Glory	   ETD June 17     13,500	China</p>
<p>Jutha Buddharaksa   ETD June 13     12,000	Japan</p>
<p>Orient Express	ETD June 16	1,200	Cambodia</p>
<p>Evpo Ageos	    N/A		 13,300	South Korea</p>
<p>Phu Yen		 ETA June 10	2,000	China</p>
<p>Pitak Samut	   ETR June 18     14,000	Japan</p>
<p>Galactica	     ETR June 20     15,750	Malaysia</p>
<p>Pipob Samut	   ETR June 20     18,000	Japan</p>
<p>Ivan Syrykh	   ARRD June 13    10,500	South Korea</p>
<p>Alam Teguh	    ETA June 19     16,800	Malaysia</p>
<p>Won San		 ETA June 19     14,000	Pakistan</p>
<p>An Lu Jiang	   N/A		 14,000	China</p>
<p>Al Qua Mar	    L/CAN 12-18     14,000	Iran</p>
<p>Orient Express I    L/CAN 23-26	1,200	Cambodia</p>
<p>Dibena Happy	  ETA June 24	5,600	Indonesia</p>
<p>Hua Yang		ETA June 14-15  12,000	South Korea</p>
<p>Dai Hong Dan	  ETA June 17	7,000	Malaysia</p>
<p>Bangkhunnon	   L/CAN 23-24	6,000	Singapore</p>
<p>Kin Zan Maru	  N/A		 13,400	Japan</p>
<p>Alam Tenteram	 ETA June 22     15,300	Malaysia</p>
<p>Bangbua		 N/A		  6,000	Indonesia</p>
<p>Golden Star	   ETA June 25     22,000	Japan</p>
<p>Dongnama Kwang Yang ETA June 23     14,000	South Korea</p>
<p>NOTE: SLD indicates that the vessel has left, ETA = Estimated Time of Arrival, ETD = Estimated Time of Departure, ETR = Estimated Time of Readiness, L/CAN indicated period when vessels are expected in for loading or be cancelled.</p>
</text>
